{
  "title": "ACM · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "HTTPS에 사용할 TLS 인증서의 발급·관리·배포를 돕는다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#public-certificates\">Public Certificates</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#dns-and-email-validation\">DNS and Email Validation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#exportable-public-certificates\">Exportable Public Certificates</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#private-certificates-and-aws-private-ca\">Private Certificates and AWS Private CA</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#imported-certificates\">Imported Certificates</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#regional-certificates-and-cloudfront\">Regional Certificates and CloudFront</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#tls-termination-and-end-to-end-encryption\">TLS Termination and End-to-end Encryption</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>01 / 62</span></div><h1>ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Certificate Manager는 TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span> 인증서의 요청·배포·지원 갱신을 관리한다. Certificate는 서버의 도메인 Identity를 증명하고 TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span> Handshake에 사용되며 저장 데이터 Encryption을 위한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> Key와 역할이 다르다.</p><p>Public·Private·Imported·Exportable 인증서는 발급·비밀 Key 관리·갱신·배포 조건이 다르다. 현재 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#exportable-public-certificates\">Exportable Public Certificate</a>가 있으므로 “ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span> 인증서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 절대 설치할 수 없다”는 오래된 설명을 그대로 적용하면 안 된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"통합 배포와 Export 배포\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>통합 배포와 Export 배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Integrated service</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span> Certificate</strong><small>Domain Validation</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></strong><small>Certificate 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span> endpoint</strong><small>지원 Managed Renewal</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>External deployment</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#exportable-public-certificates\">Exportable Public Certificate</a></strong><small>Export 허용 발급</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Certificate + Private Key</strong><small>보호해 외부 배포</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> / On-premises</strong><small>갱신 후 재배포 관리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> Viewer Certificate는 us-east-1, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 해당 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>을 확인한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"public-certificates\"><h2>Public Certificates<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#public-certificates\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Public Trust가 필요한 도메인의 Certificate를 요청한다. Domain Ownership Validation이 필요하며 Certificate의 이름과 접속 Hostname이 맞아야 한다. 지원 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 서비스와 통합하면 배포·갱신 관리가 줄어든다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dns-and-email-validation\"><h2>DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> and Email Validation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#dns-and-email-validation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Validation은 CNAME Record로 소유권을 확인하고 갱신 자동화에 적합하다. Email Validation은 지정 연락처의 승인 절차를 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Record 삭제나 권한 문제는 갱신 실패의 원인이 될 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"exportable-public-certificates\"><h2>Exportable Public Certificates<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#exportable-public-certificates\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>Export를 허용해 발급한 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#public-certificates\">Public Certificate</a>는 Private Key와 함께 Export해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·On-premises 등에도 배포할 수 있다. 2025년 6월 17일 이전 발급 인증서는 Export할 수 없다. 갱신 뒤 외부 서버로 다시 배포하는 운영 절차와 과금 조건을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"private-certificates-and-aws-private-ca\"><h2>Private Certificates and AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Private CA <span class=\"full-name\">(Certificate Authority)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#private-certificates-and-aws-private-ca\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>내부 Identity를 위한 Private CA <span class=\"full-name\">(Certificate Authority)</span>에서 Certificate를 발급한다. Client가 해당 CA <span class=\"full-name\">(Certificate Authority)</span>를 Trust하도록 배포해야 하므로 일반 Public Browser가 자동으로 신뢰하지 않는다. CA <span class=\"full-name\">(Certificate Authority)</span> 운영 비용·발급 정책·폐기와 갱신을 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"imported-certificates\"><h2>Imported Certificates<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#imported-certificates\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>외부 CA <span class=\"full-name\">(Certificate Authority)</span> Certificate와 Private Key를 ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span>에 가져올 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#imported-certificates\">Imported Certificate</a>는 ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span> 발급 인증서와 자동 갱신 조건이 다르다. 만료 모니터링과 새 Certificate 재가져오기를 준비한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"regional-certificates-and-cloudfront\"><h2>Regional Certificates and CloudFront<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#regional-certificates-and-cloudfront\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 Regional 서비스는 해당 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 Certificate를 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> Viewer용 ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span> Certificate는 us-east-1에 있어야 한다. Origin TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span>용 Certificate 위치·이름 요구는 Viewer 인증서와 별도로 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tls-termination-and-end-to-end-encryption\"><h2>TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span> Termination and End-to-end Encryption<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#tls-termination-and-end-to-end-encryption\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>에서 TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span>를 종료하면 그 뒤 Origin 연결의 Protocol을 별도로 선택한다. Client 구간 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>만으로 Backend 구간까지 암호화되지는 않는다. Certificate·Security Policy·Hostname 검증을 각 구간에 적용한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>에서 사용자 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>를 제공하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> Origin에도 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>를 사용한다. Viewer Certificate는 us-east-1, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> Certificate는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 준비한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>ACM <span class=\"full-name\">(AWS Certificate Manager)</span>은 전송 중 TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span>에, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>는 주로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">암호화 키</a> 관리에 쓰인다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/acm/latest/userguide/acm-overview.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">acm/latest/userguide/acm-overview.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/acm/latest/userguide/acm-exportable-certificates.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">acm/latest/userguide/acm-exportable-certificates.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q097\" data-question=\"Q097\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q097</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An ALB must terminate browser HTTPS connections using a certificate that is issued and renewed as a managed service. What should be attached?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ACM certificate</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 통합 서비스에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 인증서를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q066\" data-question=\"Q066\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q066</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter SQL injection patterns and excessive HTTP requests before they reach an ALB. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS STS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>가 웹 요청의 규칙·속도 기반 필터링에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q090\" data-question=\"Q090\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q090</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO services should be considered to mitigate malicious web requests and DDoS attacks in front of CloudFront?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DMS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 규칙, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호에 중점을 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">다음 용어 <b>AMI</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
